ribe  called crimson  crimson is made up of a group who wants  to go back to the old ways of the  european union even their uniforms are  hand-me-downs from that time  the problem here is a rift between its  leader general frances  cameron at david voss the general wants  to make a truce with the crows while  david wants them eliminated believing  crows can't be trusted  and they'll never honor such a truce  david so believes this that he ends up  killing the general and covering it up  to make it look like a crow attack  ensuring an  all-out war next season between the  crows and crimson david does however let  liv  live in this attack they had a brief  fling earlier on and he understands she  just wants to save her family what will  be interesting though is if liv will  reveal to others  david's treachery and if that will come  into play next season her only real  ticket to getting her family back was a  bosey prisoner by the name of grita  she was planning to trade her in  exchange for her family back but she  ends up dead  the end of liv's storyline actually  hearkens back to episode 1 which teased  her alone among a sea of dead bodies  what we didn't see in that episode was  her meeting with the feman  a tribe which seems to be based off the  femin a group of only women so it looks  like she'll be teaming up with him and  looking for a new way to get back to our  family we also haven't seen many of the  other tribes mentioned in the show which  i hope season 2 will delve further into  like the acon newlanders black skulls  and southern empire the season ends with  elia and moses  following the cube to a desolate  location south of berlin perhaps on the  mediterranean when the cube has  seemingly led them nowhere and runs out  of power elia in frustration throws it  into the water where it hovers for a  moment before plunging into the depths  moments later a  giant cube appears and what do you do  when a giant mysterious cube appears  you get into it of course and that's  exactly what moses and elia do  i don't think this is the arc itself  rather something that will transport  them to the ark it also seems man-made  judging by the caution tape-like paint  and the mechanical engineering this is  atlantean tech and as far as we know  atlanteans are human  the big question for season two is just  who these atlanteans are  how come they're able to use technology  and what do they know about this threat  to the east that could spell destruction  for all of humanity i also have a crazy  theory that elia quiano and liv's mother  chloe  isn't dead but that she's actually with  the atlanteans all we really know about  her is that she was  apparently killed by raiders and that  she had an infatuation with black  december  even cutting out newspaper clippings of  the event and collecting pre-black  december artifacts in a secluded cave by  the refugium  i could totally see her still being  alive and having somehow found the  atlanteans leaving her family because  something greater was at stake the end  of the world  that theory aside the show is actually  taking some cues from game of thrones  with the black swarm taking the place of  the white walkers and the rival tribes  being rival houses like the lannisters  and starks  it will be interesting to see how a  great external threat will change the  power dynamics between the tribes  and how this will affect the characters  reuniting thanks for watching everyone  please make sure to like and subscribe  and leave your comments and theories  about the show below  for more bad takes you can follow me on  twitter and instagram think story yt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much  you

